From 02e2941b4e10b05e1419668bba4199591676e18f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 11:23:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD selected-agent slash commands through backend command
 execution

Selected-agent chat input that begins with a slash is a provider command, not an ordinary prompt. Routing it through the backend command hook preserves native command semantics for Codex resume sessions while keeping unsupported providers on an explicit fallback path.
